WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:03.669
A microbubble crosses a cultured lung epithelial

00:00:03.669 --> 00:00:06.688
monolayer. The paper documents the apparatus. The

00:00:06.688 --> 00:00:09.708
photograph on screen is from the experiment,

00:00:09.708 --> 00:00:11.433
not a patient's lung.

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:18.786
A syringe pump drives flow through the

00:00:18.786 --> 00:00:21.921
parallel plate chamber. Its coverslips support epithelial

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:25.057
cells, while an advancing air–liquid interface creates

00:00:25.057 --> 00:00:26.401
the mechanical event.

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:33.360
The conceptual animation shows an interface moving

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:36.070
over cells. This is not a measured

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:38.780
stress field, and no velocity or force

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:39.941
has been invented.

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:49.054
Here are the real live–dead micrographs. The

00:00:49.054 --> 00:00:52.458
control and the bubble-exposed cells are separate

00:00:52.458 --> 00:00:55.376
study conditions with fluorescence-based viability staining.

00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:04.635
Seven repetitions revealed a substantially higher cell-death

00:01:04.635 --> 00:01:08.620
percentage after bubble propagation, approximately fifty-three percent,

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:11.467
compared with near-zero control death.

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:19.342
The paper also imaged F-actin and nuclei.

00:01:19.342 --> 00:01:23.034
These are its actual microscopy panels, not

00:01:23.034 --> 00:01:26.198
AI-generated cytoskeletal photographs or unrelated studies.

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:34.028
A single bubble did not yield a

00:01:34.028 --> 00:01:37.407
statistically significant change in actin organization. Differences

00:01:37.407 --> 00:01:40.785
suggested by visual inspection cannot replace the

00:01:40.785 --> 00:01:42.233
measured statistical result.

00:01:45.650 --> 00:01:48.509
The chamber makes a difficult reopening event

00:01:48.509 --> 00:01:51.367
experimentally observable. It does not on its

00:01:51.367 --> 00:01:54.226
own predict the outcome of ventilation in

00:01:54.226 --> 00:01:55.451
a living patient.
